<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>WIHP Spec Viewer</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/marked/marked.min.js"></script>
    <style>
        :root { --primary: #10B981; --primary-dark: #059669; --bg: #0f172a; --bg-card: #1e293b; --text: #f8fafc; --text-muted: #94a3b8; --border: #334155; }
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            background: #0f172a;
            color: #f8fafc;
            line-height: 1.6;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b, #0f172a);
            padding: 20px 40px;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #334155;
        }
        .header h1 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        .header h1 .emoji { font-size: 1.5rem; }
        .header h1 .gradient-text {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #10b981, #34d399);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }
        .header a.back-btn {
            color: #10b981;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border: 1px solid #10b981;
            border-radius: 6px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        .header a.back-btn:hover { 
            background: #10b981; 
            color: #0f172a; 
        }
        /* 표준 네비게이션 */
        .top-nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 15px 40px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
        .nav-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; }
        .nav-home { color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.1rem; }
        .nav-home:hover { color: var(--primary); }
        .breadcrumb { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
        .breadcrumb a { color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; }
        .breadcrumb a:hover { color: var(--primary); }
        .breadcrumb .sep { color: var(--border); }
        .breadcrumb .current { color: var(--primary); font-weight: 500; }
        .nav-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 25px; }
        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 20px; }
        .nav-links a { color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; }
        .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--primary); }
        .lang-switch { display: flex; gap: 5px; }
        footer { text-align: center; padding: 60px 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin-top: 40px; background: var(--bg-card); }
        footer .philosophy { color: var(--gold, #ffd700); font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        footer p { color: var(--text-muted); margin: 5px 0; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        footer .footer-links { margin-top: 15px; }
        footer .footer-links a { color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; margin: 0 10px; font-size: 0.85rem; }
        footer .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--primary); }
        .container {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px;
        }
        .file-browser {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .tier-section {
            background: #1e293b;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
        }
        .tier-section.core { border-color: #ffd700; }
        .tier-section.tier1 { border-color: #10b981; }
        .tier-section.tier2 { border-color: #3b82f6; }
        .tier-section.tier3 { border-color: #8b5cf6; }
        .tier-section.tier4 { border-color: #f59e0b; }
        .tier-section.special { border-color: #ec4899; }
        .tier-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #334155;
        }
        .tier-title {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }
        .tier-section.core .tier-title { color: #ffd700; }
        .tier-section.tier1 .tier-title { color: #10b981; }
        .tier-section.tier2 .tier-title { color: #3b82f6; }
        .tier-section.tier3 .tier-title { color: #8b5cf6; }
        .tier-section.tier4 .tier-title { color: #f59e0b; }
        .tier-section.special .tier-title { color: #ec4899; }
        .tier-count {
            padding: 2px 10px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .tier-section.core .tier-count { background: #ffd700; color: #0f172a; }
        .tier-section.tier1 .tier-count { background: #10b981; color: white; }
        .tier-section.tier2 .tier-count { background: #3b82f6; color: white; }
        .tier-section.tier3 .tier-count { background: #8b5cf6; color: white; }
        .tier-section.tier4 .tier-count { background: #f59e0b; color: #0f172a; }
        .tier-section.special .tier-count { background: #ec4899; color: white; }
        .file-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 6px;
            max-height: 400px;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }
        .file-list::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
        .file-list::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #1e293b; }
        .file-list::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #334155; border-radius: 3px; }
        .file-link {
            display: block;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
            border-radius: 6px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .file-link:hover {
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
            color: #10b981;
        }
        .file-link .lang-name {
            color: #f8fafc;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .subsection {
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding-top: 10px;
            border-top: 1px dashed #334155;
        }
        .subsection-title {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        /* Markdown viewer */
        .content {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px;
        }
        .content h1 { 
            font-size: 2rem; 
            color: #10b981; 
            margin: 30px 0 20px; 
            border-bottom: 1px solid #334155; 
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .content h2 { 
            font-size: 1.5rem; 
            color: #10b981; 
            margin: 25px 0 15px; 
            border-bottom: 1px solid #334155; 
            padding-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .content h3 { 
            font-size: 1.25rem; 
            color: #94a3b8; 
            margin: 20px 0 10px;
        }
        .content p { margin: 15px 0; }
        .content ul, .content ol { margin: 15px 0; padding-left: 30px; }
        .content li { margin: 8px 0; }
        .content code {
            background: #1e293b;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-family: 'SF Mono', Monaco, monospace;
            color: #f59e0b;
        }
        .content pre {
            background: #1e293b;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow-x: auto;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
        }
        .content pre code {
            background: none;
            padding: 0;
            color: #f8fafc;
        }
        .content table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .content th, .content td {
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .content th {
            background: #1e293b;
            color: #10b981;
        }
        .content tr:hover {
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.05);
        }
        .content blockquote {
            border-left: 4px solid #10b981;
            padding-left: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }
        .content a { color: #10b981; text-decoration: none; }
        .content a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
        .loading { text-align: center; padding: 60px; color: #94a3b8; }
        .page-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .page-title h2 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: #f8fafc;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .page-title p { color: #94a3b8; }
        .stats {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 30px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .stat-item {
            text-align: center;
        }
        .stat-number {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #10b981;
        }
        .stat-label {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }
            .lang-btn { padding: 6px 12px; border: 1px solid #334155; background: transparent; color: #94a3b8; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; }
        .lang-btn:hover { border-color: #10b981; color: #10b981; }
        .lang-btn.active { background: #10b981; color: white; border-color: #10b981; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="top-nav">
        <div class="nav-left">
            <a href="https://wiastandards.com" class="nav-home" target="_blank">🤟 WIA Standards</a>
            <div class="breadcrumb">
                <a href="https://wiastandards.com" target="_blank">Home</a>
                <span class="sep">›</span>
                <a href="https://wiastandards.com/#standards" target="_blank" data-en="Standards" data-ko="표준">Standards</a>
                <span class="sep">›</span>
                <a href="/wihp/">WIHP</a>
                <span class="sep">›</span>
                <span class="current" data-en="Language Mappings" data-ko="언어 매핑">Language Mappings</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-right">
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="https://cert.wiastandards.com" target="_blank" data-en="🏅 Certification" data-ko="🏅 인증">🏅 Certification</a>
                <a href="https://wiastandards.com" target="_blank" data-en="🎮 109+ Simulators" data-ko="🎮 109+ 시뮬레이터">🎮 109+ Simulators</a>
                <a href="https://wiabooks.store" target="_blank" data-en="📚 Ebook" data-ko="📚 전자책">📚 Ebook</a>
                <a href="https://github.com/WIA-Official/WIHP" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
            </div>
            <div class="lang-switch">
                <button class="lang-btn active" onclick="setLang('en')">EN</button>
                <button class="lang-btn" onclick="setLang('ko')">KO</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div id="browser" class="container">
        <div class="page-title">
            <h2 data-en="📖 WIHP Language Mappings" data-ko="📖 WIHP 언어 매핑">📖 WIHP Language Mappings</h2>
            <p data-en="Universal Hangul Phonetic Standard for 196 World Languages" data-ko="196개 세계 언어를 위한 범용 한글 음성 표준">Universal Hangul Phonetic Standard for 196 World Languages</p>
            <div class="stats">
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <div class="stat-number">196</div>
                    <div class="stat-label" data-en="Languages" data-ko="언어">Languages</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <div class="stat-number">4</div>
                    <div class="stat-label" data-en="Tiers" data-ko="티어">Tiers</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <div class="stat-number">3</div>
                    <div class="stat-label" data-en="Core Maps" data-ko="코어 맵">Core Maps</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="file-browser">
            <!-- Core Mappings -->
            <div class="tier-section core">
                <div class="tier-header">
                    <span class="tier-title" data-en="🎯 Core Mappings" data-ko="🎯 코어 매핑">🎯 Core Mappings</span>
                    <span class="tier-count">4</span>
                </div>
                <div class="file-list">
                    <a href="?file=wihp/core/WIHP-MAP-CONSONANTS.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">자음 Consonants</span> - IPA Mapping</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/core/WIHP-MAP-VOWELS.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">모음 Vowels</span> - IPA Mapping</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/core/WIHP-MAP-DIACRITICS.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">기호 Diacritics</span> - IPA Mapping</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/core/korean-kor.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">한국어 Korean</span> - Base Language</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Tier 1 - Major Languages (20) -->
            <div class="tier-section tier1">
                <div class="tier-header">
                    <span class="tier-title" data-en="🌟 Tier 1 - Major Languages" data-ko="🌟 티어 1 - 주요 언어">🌟 Tier 1 - Major Languages</span>
                    <span class="tier-count">20</span>
                </div>
                <div class="file-list">
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier1/arabic-arb.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Arabic</span> 아랍어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier1/bengali-ben.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Bengali</span> 벵골어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier1/dutch-nld.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Dutch</span> 네덜란드어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier1/english-eng.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">English</span> 영어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier1/french-fra.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">French</span> 프랑스어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier1/german-deu.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">German</span> 독일어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier1/greek-ell.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Greek</span> 그리스어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier1/hindi-hin.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Hindi</span> 힌디어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier1/indonesian-ind.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Indonesian</span> 인도네시아어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier1/italian-ita.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Italian</span> 이탈리아어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier1/japanese-jpn.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Japanese</span> 일본어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier1/korean-kor.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Korean</span> 한국어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier1/mandarin-cmn.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Mandarin</span> 중국어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier1/polish-pol.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Polish</span> 폴란드어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier1/portuguese-por.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Portuguese</span> 포르투갈어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier1/russian-rus.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Russian</span> 러시아어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier1/spanish-spa.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Spanish</span> 스페인어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier1/thai-tha.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Thai</span> 태국어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier1/turkish-tur.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Turkish</span> 터키어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier1/vietnamese-vie.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Vietnamese</span> 베트남어</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Tier 2 - Regional Languages (25) -->
            <div class="tier-section tier2">
                <div class="tier-header">
                    <span class="tier-title" data-en="🌍 Tier 2 - Regional Languages" data-ko="🌍 티어 2 - 지역 언어">🌍 Tier 2 - Regional Languages</span>
                    <span class="tier-count">25</span>
                </div>
                <div class="file-list">
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/amharic-amh.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Amharic</span> 암하라어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/burmese-mya.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Burmese</span> 미얀마어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/cantonese-yue.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Cantonese</span> 광동어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/gujarati-guj.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Gujarati</span> 구자라트어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/hausa-hau.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Hausa</span> 하우사어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/hebrew-heb.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Hebrew</span> 히브리어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/hungarian-hun.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Hungarian</span> 헝가리어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/igbo-ibo.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Igbo</span> 이그보어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/kannada-kan.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Kannada</span> 칸나다어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/khmer-khm.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Khmer</span> 크메르어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/lao-lao.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Lao</span> 라오어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/malayalam-mal.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Malayalam</span> 말라얄람어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/marathi-mar.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Marathi</span> 마라티어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/nepali-nep.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Nepali</span> 네팔어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/persian-fas.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Persian</span> 페르시아어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/punjabi-pan.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Punjabi</span> 펀자브어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/romanian-ron.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Romanian</span> 루마니아어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/sinhala-sin.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Sinhala</span> 싱할라어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/swahili-swa.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Swahili</span> 스와힐리어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/tagalog-tgl.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Tagalog</span> 타갈로그어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/tamil-tam.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Tamil</span> 타밀어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/telugu-tel.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Telugu</span> 텔루구어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/ukrainian-ukr.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Ukrainian</span> 우크라이나어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/urdu-urd.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Urdu</span> 우르두어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier2/yoruba-yor.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Yoruba</span> 요루바어</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Tier 3 - Extended Languages (30) -->
            <div class="tier-section tier3">
                <div class="tier-header">
                    <span class="tier-title" data-en="🔮 Tier 3 - Extended Languages" data-ko="🔮 티어 3 - 확장 언어">🔮 Tier 3 - Extended Languages</span>
                    <span class="tier-count">30</span>
                </div>
                <div class="file-list">
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier3/armenian-hye.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Armenian</span> 아르메니아어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier3/assamese-asm.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Assamese</span> 아삼어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier3/basque-eus.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Basque</span> 바스크어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier3/catalan-cat.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Catalan</span> 카탈루냐어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier3/cebuano-ceb.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Cebuano</span> 세부아노어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier3/georgian-kat.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Georgian</span> 조지아어</a>
                    <a href="?file=wihp/tier3/hawaiian-haw.md" class="file-link"><span class="lang-name">Hawaiian</span> 하와이어</a>
